## 🔌 Por Componente

### Hummingbot API
**Propósito**: Runtime de trading, account management, executores

**Documentação**:
- Setup: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#1-hummingbot-api)
- Contracts: [AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md](AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md#hummingbot-api)
- API Docs: `http://localhost:8000/docs`
- GitHub: https://github.com/Axodus/hummingbot-api
- Port: `8000`

**Endpoints principais**:
- `GET /health` - Health check
- `GET /accounts/` - Listar accounts
- `POST /market-data/candles` - Candles
- `POST /trading/orders` - Colocar ordem
- `GET /portfolio/state` - Portfolio

---

### Quants-Lab
**Propósito**: Backtesting, otimização, relatórios, aprovações

**Documentação**:
- Setup: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#2-quants-lab)
- Contracts: [AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md](AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md#quants-lab-api)
- Trinity Integration: `/opt/quants-lab/docs/trinity-integration.md`
- API Docs: `http://localhost:8075/docs`
- GitHub: https://github.com/Axodus/quants-lab
- Port: `8075`

**Endpoints principais**:
- `POST /api/v1/strategies/validate` - Validar manifesto
- `POST /api/v1/backtests` - Rodar backtest
- `POST /api/v1/optimizations` - Rodar otimização
- `GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}` - Poll status
- `GET /api/v1/reports/{study_name}` - Fetch relatório
- `GET /api/v1/approvals` - Listar approvals

---

### Condor
**Propósito**: Interface Telegram, monitoramento, trading manual

**Documentação**:
- Setup: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#3-condor)
- API Docs: `http://localhost:8088/docs`
- GitHub: https://github.com/Axodus/condor
- Port: `8088`

**Principais features**:
- `/portfolio` - Dashboard PnL
- `/bots` - Status de bots
- `/trade` - CEX trading
- `/swap` - DEX swap
- `/config` - Configuração

---

### MCP Hummingbot
**Propósito**: AI integration via Model Context Protocol

**Documentação**:
- Setup: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#4-mcp-hummingbot)
- GitHub: https://github.com/Axodus/mcp-hummingbot
- Port: `3000` (MCP HTTP)

**Principais tools**:
- `configure_api_servers()` - Configurar conexão
- `get_portfolio_overview()` - Portfolio unificado
- `place_order()` - Colocar ordem
- `search_history()` - Histórico de trades

---

### OpenClaw Trinity
**Propósito**: Agent de orquestração e criação de estratégias

**Documentação**:
- Overview: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#5-openclawtrinity-externo)
- Integration: `/opt/hummingbot-api/docs/TRINITY_INTEGRATION.md`
- Runbook: [AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md](AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md#1️⃣-trinity-agent---runbook)
- GitHub: https://github.com/Axodus/openclaw-trinity

---

## 📋 Por Tarefa

### Setup Inicial
1. Validar pré-requisitos: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#pré-requisitos)
2. Preencher environment: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#passo-1-ambiente)
3. Bootstrap: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#passo-2-bootstrap-da-stack)
4. Validar integrações: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#passo-3-validar-integrações)

### Integrar Trinity
1. Ler: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#5-openclawtrinity-externo)
2. Ler: `/opt/hummingbot-api/docs/TRINITY_INTEGRATION.md`
3. Ler: `/opt/quants-lab/docs/trinity-integration.md`
4. Implementar: [AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md](AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md#fluxo-1-criação-e-deploy-de-estratégia-rápido)

### Monitorar Portfolio
1. Usar Telegram: [AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md](AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md#via-telegram-condor)
2. Ou API: [AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md](AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md#via-api-1)

### Aprovar Estratégia
1. Ler: [AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md](AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md#fluxo-aprovar-estratégia)
2. Revisar relatório
3. Decidir APPROVE/REJECT

### Troubleshoot API
1. Verificar status: [AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#-troubleshooting)
2. Ler logs: `docker compose logs -f <service>`
3. Ler error codes: [AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md](AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md#-padrões-de-erro)

