## 🔗 Integração Rápida

### Trinity ← → Quants-Lab

**Fluxo**:
```
Trinity → POST /api/v1/strategies/validate → Validar
       → POST /api/v1/backtests → Rodar teste
       → POST /api/v1/optimizations → Rodar otimização
       → GET /api/v1/jobs/{id} → Poll status
       → GET /api/v1/reports/{name} → Ler resultados
```

**Docs**:
- [Operação](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#-contratos-de-api-unificados)
- [Technical](AXODUS_TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md#quants-lab-api)

### Quants-Lab ← → Hummingbot API

**Fluxo**:
```
Quants-Lab → Deploy approved strategy
          → POST /executors/ → Criar executor
          → Monitor via GET /portfolio/state
```

**Docs**:
- [Operação](AXODUS_OPERATIONAL_GUIDE.md#fluxo-2-trinity-→-otimização-→-aprovação-→-deploy)

### Operador ← → Hummingbot API

**Fluxo**:
```
Operador → /trade (Telegram)
        → Condor → POST /trading/orders
        → Hummingbot API executa
```

**Docs**:
- [Runbook](AXODUS_RUNBOOKS_BY_PERSONA.md#fluxo-executar-trade-manual)

